{
  "id": "piranport:torpedo_manual_reload",
  "items": [
    "piranport:quad_torpedo_launcher",
    "piranport:torpedo_533mm",
    "piranport:torpedo_reload"
  ],
  "title": {
    "zh_cn": "皮兰港：鱼雷手动装填",
    "en_us": "Piran Port: Manual Torpedo Reload"
  },
  "tags": ["piranport", "torpedo", "reload"],
  "editable": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "manual_load",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "拖鱼雷到发射器上",
        "en_us": "Drag Torpedoes onto the Launcher"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 2.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:quad_torpedo_launcher",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "没有装填设施也能装鱼雷：前提是变身用的舰装核心里装着鱼雷再装填强化件。",
            "en_us": "No Reload Facility? You can still load torpedoes — as long as your transformed ship core carries a Torpedo Reload enhancement."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.6, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [3.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 4,
          "item": "piranport:torpedo_533mm",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "背包里拿起鱼雷，右键拖到空的发射器上：一次吃满全部发射管，鱼雷口径必须与发射器口径一致。",
            "en_us": "Pick up torpedoes in the inventory and right-click them onto an empty launcher: it loads every tube at once, and the caliber must match the launcher."
          },
          "point": [3.5, 3.4, 2.5],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 100
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "装满的发射器直接可用。没装鱼雷再装填强化件时这个操作无效，只能去装填设施预装。",
            "en_us": "A full launcher is ready to fire right away. Without the Torpedo Reload enhancement this gesture does nothing — pre-load at a Reload Facility instead."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reload_rules",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "满换与半装规则",
        "en_us": "Full-Swap and Partial-Load Rules"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 2.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:quad_torpedo_launcher",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "打到一半的发射器拒绝补装——要么射空再装，要么整管换新弹。没有“补几根”这种事。",
            "en_us": "A half-spent launcher refuses top-ups — fire it dry or swap the whole load. There is no partial reload."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.6, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [3.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 4,
          "item": "piranport:torpedo_533mm_mk17",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "发射器已满时拖入不同型号鱼雷 = 整管换弹：旧鱼雷退回背包，新鱼雷一次装满。换弹也需要足够数量填满全部管。",
            "en_us": "Dragging a different torpedo type onto a full launcher swaps the whole salvo: the old fish go back to your bag, the new ones fill every tube. You still need enough for a complete load."
          },
          "point": [3.5, 3.4, 2.5],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 100
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "同型号再拖会被拒绝（已满）。这套规则和装填设施完全一致——设施是自动化版，手动是随身版。",
            "en_us": "Re-dragging the same type is refused (already full). Same rules as the Reload Facility — the facility just automates what you can do by hand."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
